            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Kavalos Deathriders** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the ^^**Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
