          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Shoot^^** ability for this unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, if all of this unit&apos;s attacks targeted the same enemy unit, roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if this unit is wholly within 12&quot; of a friendly **Mortisan Ossifector**, and add 1 to the roll if any other friendly **Mortek Crawler** units picked that enemy unit to be the target of all of their shooting attacks this turn. On a 4+, the target has **^^Strike-Last^^** for the rest of the turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
