            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn:
• This unit&apos;s ranged weapons have **Anti-^^Faction Terrain^^ (+1 Rend)**.
• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit&apos;s ranged weapons for attacks that target faction terrain features.</characteristic>
