            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each enemy unit that has been destroyed this battle. Add 1 to each roll if this unit used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn. If any of the rolls are a 4+, this unit is **full**.</characteristic>
