            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this ^^**Manifestation^^** was destroyed or banished this turn and the unit that summoned it is on the battlefield, roll a dice. On a 4+, set up this **^^Manifestation^^** again, wholly within 12&quot; of the unit that summoned it and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. That unit has summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**. Add 1 to the roll if any enemy models were slain by this **^^Manifestation^^**&apos;s combat attacks this turn.</characteristic>
